@startuml
title MDR-D07 Operational Failure and Staleness Handling
skinparam shadowing false

start
:User opens dashboard;
:Dashboard queries projection/read model;

if (Source unavailable?) then (yes)
  :Show source unavailable label;
  :Disable unsafe interpretation;
  :Keep authority actions absent;
elseif (Projection stale?) then (yes)
  :Show stale timestamp and threshold breach;
  :Mark metrics as operational visibility only;
  :Prevent export from implying real-time authority;
elseif (Audit unavailable?) then (yes)
  :Show audit logging degraded warning;
  :Disable export and privileged evidence views;
elseif (Export disabled?) then (yes)
  :Show export unavailable message;
  :Keep view-only dashboard available where allowed;
elseif (Partial data available?) then (yes)
  :Show partial data banner and missing source labels;
  :Exclude incomplete metrics from authoritative summaries;
else (no)
  :Display dashboard with source-of-truth labels;
  :Display freshness indicators;
endif

:Log report view/denial when audit is available;
:Never present stale or incomplete data as payment, fiscal, exit, gate, discount, continuity, or reconciliation authority;
stop
@enduml
